# Nothing in this repository is built, so an entry here is about what must never
# ARRIVE in the tree rather than about generated output.

.DS_Store

# A real settings file copied to the repo root to diff against the template.
# `~/.claude/settings.json` holds a user's AWS profile and their accumulated
# permission grants; `install.sh` refuses to overwrite it for that reason, and it
# has no business being committed here either. Anchored with a leading slash on
# purpose: `templates/settings.json.template` and `.claude/settings.json` are both
# tracked deliberately, and an unanchored `settings.json` would match the second.
/settings.json
settings.local.json

# `.claude/settings.json` is TRACKED, deliberately -- see the Git section of
# CLAUDE.md. Only per-machine overrides are ignored.
.claude/settings.local.json
